== mixture/checks/gmm_check.mojo [IDENTICAL] profile=mojolearn.identical.gmm.full.fp32.v1 max_iter=40 ==
check_gmm_refusals OK [IDENTICAL]: 15 refusals by name (3 covariance types, 3 init_params, 3 non-finite, 2 n_components, tol, reg_covar, a collapsed component citing DEVIATION 1723 with its component and info); 'full', 'kmeans', 'random' and the same collapse fixture at reg_covar=1e-6 all ACCEPTED, so the refusals are not always firing
check_collapse_is_identical OK [IDENTICAL]: COLLAPSE at reg_covar=+0.0 refuses on the device and on the float32 oracle, at the same component (2) with the same LAPACK info (1), at iteration 0 (0 = initialization); two runs' messages are identical and their partial cards are identical at all 11 records
check_iteration_count_is_identical OK [IDENTICAL]: 5 fixtures, two fits each from one seed, agreeing on the ITERATION COUNT, the convergence flag, the lower bound's BITS and every parameter cell; SEPARATED=2c OVERLAP=2c DUPLICATES=2c ONE_D=2c SIGNED_ZERO=2c (c = converged, x = ran out). The count is emitted as gmm.niter = [n_iter, converged, max_iter]
check_estep_vs_oracle OK [IDENTICAL]: 765 cells bit-equal to the serial oracle across 5 fixtures (mahal, wlp, rowmax, lse, logresp, meanll); the naive log-sum-exp underflowed to -inf where the shifted one did not; an all--inf row is 0xff800000 on device AND oracle (DEVIATION 1727); 2 planted mixed-zero rows x 3 block sizes keep the LOWER-INDEX zero's bits on both (row 39)
check_mstep_vs_oracle OK [IDENTICAL]: 732 cells bit-equal to the serial oracle across 12 fixture-divisor pairs (resp, nk, weights, means, covariances); BOTH scikit-learn divisors driven -- _initialize's n_samples and _m_step's sum(nk)
check_log_likelihood_by_hand OK [IDENTICAL]: 3 one-dimensional configurations equal their hand-derived closed forms BIT FOR BIT (x at the mean, x one away, and the same distance reached through the MEAN rather than the point -- exercising the subtraction and the point separately and requiring them to agree); configuration 4 (weights 0.25/0.75, so the row max is component 1 and the shift is not zero) is within 4.442207357513439e-08 of the float64 reference
check_recovers_planted_parameters OK [IDENTICAL]: SEPARATED converged in 2 iterations; components matched by the IEEE totalOrder of their mean vector (never by slot); worst |mean - plant| 0x36000000, worst |cov - plant| 0x34000000, worst |weight - 1/3| 0x33000000; predict gives one label per planted cluster and predict_proba is exactly one-hot; score=0xc06daf75 bic=0x43684a7c aic=0x43544398
